# Atomic Image Builder

Nobody currently develops this repo in Cursor. This file exists so that if
someone does, they get the same brief every other agent gets rather than
inferring the conventions from the code.

**Read [`.github/copilot-instructions.md`](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md).**
It is the canonical guidance: what the project is, the checks that gate a
change, and the handful of things that are easy to get wrong in this repo
specifically. From there it points at ARCHITECTURE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
MAINTAINER.md and maintenance_notes.txt.

Nothing from that file is repeated here, deliberately. Four copies of the same
conventions would be four things to keep in step, and a test enforces that
this file stays a pointer.
